      "bio": {
        "employment_record": {
          "value": "Left research career to serve as a science and tech expert in federal government. Worked in the U.S. Senate, at the National Institutes of Health, and at the U.S. Government Accountability Office.",
          "source_url": "https://www.drkristinhook.org/",
          "snippet": "When the pandemic hit, I left my research career to serve the public as a science and tech expert in our federal government. In the U.S. Senate, I fought corruption and helped write bipartisan laws that invest in safer communities, clean water, and good-paying union jobs. At the National Institutes of Health, I worked to expand access to health care. And at the U.S. Government Accountability Office, I helped Congress use facts to solve real-world problems, protected your hard-earned tax dollars from waste, and served as an elected union leader to stand up for hundreds of federal workers.",
          "source_type": "llm_extracted_campaign_site"
        },
        "civic_affiliations": {
